---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: chbench_q21"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |  Sort: numwait DESC NULLS FIRST, supplier.su_name ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Projection: supplier.su_name, count(Int64(1)) AS numwait                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[supplier.su_name]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: supplier.su_nationkey = nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |         Inner Join:  Filter: l1.ol_w_id = stock.s_w_id AND l1.ol_i_id = stock.s_i_id AND mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id, Int64(10000)) = supplier.su_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: l1.ol_o_id = oorder.o_id AND l1.ol_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND l1.ol_d_id = oorder.o_d_id AND l1.ol_delivery_d > oorder.o_entry_d                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |             Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |               Filter: NOT EXISTS (<subquery>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                 Subquery:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   Projection: l2.ol_o_id, l2.ol_d_id, l2.ol_w_id, l2.ol_number, l2.ol_i_id, l2.ol_supply_w_id, l2.ol_delivery_d, l2.ol_quantity, l2.ol_amount, l2.ol_dist_info, l2._bench_ts                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                     Filter: l2.ol_o_id = outer_ref(l1.ol_o_id) AND l2.ol_w_id = outer_ref(l1.ol_w_id) AND l2.ol_d_id = outer_ref(l1.ol_d_id) AND l2.ol_delivery_d > outer_ref(l1.ol_delivery_d)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                       SubqueryAlias: l2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                         TableScan: order_line                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                 TableScan: supplier projection=[su_suppkey, su_name, su_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: l1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                 TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_o_id, ol_d_id, ol_w_id, ol_i_id, ol_delivery_d]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |             TableScan: oorder projection=[o_id, o_d_id, o_w_id, o_entry_d]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           TableScan: stock projection=[s_i_id, s_w_id]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |         TableScan: nation projection=[n_nationkey], full_filters=[nation.n_name = Utf8("CHINA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "supplier"."su_name", count(1) AS "numwait" FROM "supplier" INNER JOIN "order_line" AS "l1" ON NOT EXISTS (SELECT "l2"."ol_o_id", "l2"."ol_d_id", "l2"."ol_w_id", "l2"."ol_number", "l2"."ol_i_id", "l2"."ol_supply_w_id", "l2"."ol_delivery_d", "l2"."ol_quantity", "l2"."ol_amount", "l2"."ol_dist_info", "l2"."_bench_ts" FROM "order_line" AS "l2" WHERE (((("l2"."ol_o_id" = "l1"."ol_o_id") AND ("l2"."ol_w_id" = "l1"."ol_w_id")) AND ("l2"."ol_d_id" = "l1"."ol_d_id")) AND ("l2"."ol_delivery_d" > "l1"."ol_delivery_d"))) INNER JOIN "oorder" ON (((("l1"."ol_o_id" = "oorder"."o_id") AND ("l1"."ol_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id")) AND ("l1"."ol_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) AND ("l1"."ol_delivery_d" > "oorder"."o_entry_d")) INNER JOIN "stock" ON ((("l1"."ol_w_id" = "stock"."s_w_id") AND ("l1"."ol_i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id")) AND (mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000) = "supplier"."su_suppkey")) INNER JOIN "nation" ON (("supplier"."su_nationkey" = "nation"."n_nationkey") AND ("nation"."n_name" = 'CHINA')) GROUP BY "supplier"."su_name" ORDER BY "numwait" DESC NULLS FIRST, "supplier"."su_name" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
